  "method": [
    "Subset against actual nativeName codepoints; keep all available Arabic cmap letters and all 751 upstream Arabic presentation forms, not only isolated letters.",
    "Keep GSUB/GPOS layout features and their glyph closure, copyright/license records; remove TrueType hint instructions and rename derived faces to Pando World.",
