    "Greek and Cyrillic characters in the current source are already covered by the existing Pretendard / Noto CJK fonts; no redundant fallback is bundled."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "These assets add missing outlines only. Arabic/Indic/Thai shaping and bidirectional layout require separate renderer work.",
